條表現優秀，軟硬適中，吸附湯汁的能力很好。\n• 辛麻婆拉麵： 辣度適中，不會過於刺激，怕辣的人也可以大膽嘗試。\n• 唐揚雞（強烈推薦）： 這次最驚艷的一道！雞肉非常軟嫩多汁，外皮酥度剛好，火候控制得非常棒。\n• 餃子： 雖然個頭偏小，但味道精緻，底部煎得鹹香，適合點來配麵。\n• 可麗餅： 沒想到拉麵店的甜點也這麼強，餅皮非常酥脆，作為飯後甜點超級滿足。\n整體來說是一次很愉快的用餐體驗，會想再訪！",null,[0,122]]]],[null,1777264400000000,1777264400000000,"4 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfMmhGeFBkZ3NNdDcteWxOSlJDME1KUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfMmhGeFBkZ3NNdDcteWxOSlJDME1KURoTQ2d3SWtNNjd6d1lRM08tcXJRSQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjulpqgutKWAxX8jq8BHcI4A10Q_2MIcSgO"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7218070318606483481/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzVjFsc1draFBWM016VjFjNWJWcFVSbHBPUnpCNFYxWmtlRmRIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7218070318606483481/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzVjFsc1draFBWM016VjFjNWJWcFVSbHBPUnpCNFYxWmtlRmRIWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7218070318606483481/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzVjFsc1draFBWM016VjFjNWJWcFVSbHBPUnpCNFYxWmtlRmRIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7218070318606483481/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzVjFsc1draFBWM016VjFjNWJWcFVSbHBPUnpCNFYxWmtlRmRIWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7218070318606483481/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzVjFsc1draFBWM016VjFjNWJWcFVSbHBPUnpCNFYxWmtlRmRIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7218070318606483481/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzVjFsc1draFBWM016VjFjNWJWcFVSbHBPUnpCNFYxWmtlRmRIWXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝培培這麼詳盡的點評！看到您從拉麵、炸雞一路吃到可麗餅都沒踩雷，我們真的超有成就感的！\n\n既然黑蒜跟辛麻婆您都覺得不錯，下次再來試試看我們的雞豚醬油拉麵，口感也是一絕！等您再訪，我們再用好吃的料理歡迎您！",null,[0,103]]]],[null,null,7109,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sV1lsWkhPV3MzV1c5bVpURlpOR