al/business/7218070318606483481/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0UTFSSVRrcFdSVFZzWkVSc1JWWXhVbFZTVmprMVVtMW9RMWR0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7218070318606483481/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0UTFSSVRrcFdSVFZzWkVSc1JWWXhVbFZTVmprMVVtMW9RMWR0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7218070318606483481/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0UTFSSVRrcFdSVFZzWkVSc1JWWXhVbFZTVmprMVVtMW9RMWR0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7218070318606483481/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0UTFSSVRrcFdSVFZzWkVSc1JWWXhVbFZTVmprMVVtMW9RMWR0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7218070318606483481/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0UTFSSVRrcFdSVFZzWkVSc1JWWXhVbFZTVmprMVVtMW9RMWR0WXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["您好，非常抱歉讓您有了這麼糟糕的用餐體驗。\n關於店員當時的回應，主要是因為我們內場煮麵和熬湯的設備確實會產生極大的熱氣，那幾天體感溫度高達 40 度，加上大門開開關關讓外頭的熱氣一直衝進來，開放式廚房又不斷地熬湯，冷氣確實很難發揮功效。我們已經在積極規劃並陸續調整、優化冷氣與抽風設備，希望能徹底改善悶熱的情況。\n若您是拉麵愛好者應該可以品嚐出我們的真材實料，不過被天氣影響了食慾確實也很難吃出美味，再次向您致上最深的歉意。",null,[0,212]]]],[null,null,2897,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4Q1RITkpWRTVsZERsRVYxUlVSVjk1Um1oQ1dtYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xf2fbbec675880acd!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkxCTHNJVE5ldDlEV1RURV95RmhCWmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4Q1RITkpWRTVsZERsRVYxUlVSVjk1Um1oQ1dtYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4Q1RITkpWRTVsZERsRVYxUlVSVjk1Um1oQ1dtYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4Q1RITkpWRTVsZERsRVYxUlVSVjk1Um1oQ1dtYxILMGUzYzZVYkd6ZzEaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09reENUSE5KVkU1bGREbEVWMVJVUlY5NVJtaENXbWMSCzBlM2M2VWJHemcxIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARzQqIdca--_IqCzBlM2M2VWJHemcx\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjulpqgutKWAxX8jq8BHcI4A10QoykIhgIoCQ"],null,[null,[[1,