ly?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLVFdGRmJFTlRWMXBvV210d2IySkhPWGxaVmpsS1RsZFdVMWRHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7218070318606483481/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLVFdGRmJFTlRWMXBvV210d2IySkhPWGxaVmpsS1RsZFdVMWRHUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝大志！能聽到您說我們的味道甚至比日本一蘭更棒，真的太榮幸了！\n\n我們對湯頭的層次感確實下足了功夫，就是希望讓客人在第一口就能感受到新鮮熬煮的用心。看到您連炸雞也都全部掃光，還遇上贈送活動，這份飽足感與滿足感就是我們最想帶給客人的！\n\n感謝您的熱情推薦，下次想念道地的博多豚骨味時，不必飛日本，隨時過來就對了！期待再見到您！",null,[0,32]]]],[null,null,11978,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKTWFFbENTV1poWmtwb2JHOXlZVjlKTldWU1dGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xf2fbbec675880acd!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjJMaElCSWZhZkpobG9yYV9JNWVSWFE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKTWFFbENTV1poWmtwb2JHOXlZVjlKTldWU1dGRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKTWFFbENTV1poWmtwb2JHOXlZVjlKTldWU1dGRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKTWFFbENTV1poWmtwb2JHOXlZVjlKTldWU1dGRRILMGRjYlFjQ0FNZmsaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qSk1hRWxDU1daaFprcG9iRzl5WVY5Sk5XVlNXRkUSCzBkY2JRY0NBTWZrIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARzQqIdca--_IqCzBkY2JRY0NBTWZr\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjulpqgutKWAxX8jq8BHcI4A10QoykIwgIoDg"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwiMy6OgutKWAxXydV4EHeL4EVcQ0pMFCNIBKAc"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjulpqgutKWAxX8jq8BHcI4A10Q0pMFCKgCKAc"]],null,null,null,"other_user_google_review_posts__and__hotel_and_vr_partner_review_posts",null,"CjEIARIpCgoAP7_LACwL____EhD2fbADh8jvlQVrMOQAAAAAGgn92PYCY11fhOIYACIA"]],null,null,null,[3,1,null,null,null,[2]],["顧客表示這家拉麵店的豚骨拉麵濃郁夠味，湯頭濃淡和麵條軟硬度都可以客製化。他們特別提到美味的炸雞和煎餃，以及乾淨的洗手間和營業到深夜的優點。\n\n部分評論則提到，拉麵的口味有時候可能偏鹹。",null,"https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5%401:CAIQACodChtyc19oOkt1aGI3bmhHOHRleVV0U3BCTTVnMHc%7CCAIQACorChtyc19oOkt1aGI3bmhHOHRleVV0U3BCTTVnMHcSDAip4OHTBhDQn_PEAQ\u0026d\u003d286732321\u0026t\u003d8",142,null,[["https://lh3.googleuserconte